    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "111d103720b8b3a41287": "Train me.",
        "3791f37c2a634545fed0": "Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need.",
        "817e41da58e1aa9138a2": "Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!",
        "bcf4271f77ad00bdd01f": "Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so.",
        "f92cad0a52c90eec54b1": "Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need."
      },
      "name": "Vosur Brakthel",
      "subName": "Journeyman Alchemist",
